# tool/fetch_fixtures.sh downloads REAL substitution plans, timetables and the
# timetable page from the school's Basic-Auth area. They contain teacher data
# and must never be committed to this public repo. The tracked fixtures are
# synthetic stand-ins (git keeps tracking them); add a new synthetic fixture
# with `git add -f`.
